    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετάω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰρ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thrive, prosper,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀρετᾷ κακὰ ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.329
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαοὶ ἀρετῶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.114
				</span></i>
			: in late Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετῶσα γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.372
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάνοια</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				280
			</span></i>:— 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν ἀρετήσηται αὐτοῦ
			τὰ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGiss.</u>
				67.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>choose the path of valour,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				4.35
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aed.</u>
				1
			</span></i>
			<u>Prooem.</u>
        </div>
